            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "EXCEPTIUS Corpus v1.0, containing the following data:<br>\n- raw documents for 21 countries at national level<br>\n- pre-processed data with spacy-udpipe v1.0<br>\n- automatically annotated documents for the identification of exceptional measures at sentence level<br>\n\n<br>\nCountry list (ISO 3166-1 alpha-2): AT, BE, HR, CY, CZ, DK, FR, DE, HU, IE, IT, LV, LT, NL, NO, PL, SI, SE, CH, UK \n<br>\n<br>\nFolder structure: each country has a dedicated folder. Inside each folder you will find the following subfolders: <br>\n- raw_text: the raw text data (.txt format) <br> \n- processed: the output of the spacy-udpipe v1.0 - each line is a sentence, containing the following info: tokens, lemma, POS, UD dependency relations<br>\n- model: the predictions of the trained model (XML pre@36 as reported in Table 4 of the paper). Each line is a sentence, separate by 9 tab - each for a exceptional measure class. 1: signals presence of a class.\n<br>\n<br>\nThe Italy and Norway folder misses the predictions of the models."
                },
                "dsDescriptionDate": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionDate",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "2021-11-26"
                }
              }
